==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.
**2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This still isn't too hard. Continue to use this level to dump your Labyrinth fodder here. If you're actually worried, at least make sure your fodder targets Red.

